OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 12 SEP
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1965FBBC Two begins broadcasting in
OL,7,FWales. BBC Two airs a special
OL,8,Fprogramme, BBC-2 Comes to Wales, at
OL,9,F1.40pm.
OL,10,
OL,11,CG1980FThe BBC English regions provide
OL,12,Flocal continuity during the evening on
OL,13,FBBC One for the final time.
OL,14,
OL,15,FAs part of financial cutbacks, local
OL,16,Fcontinuity and news at closedown is
OL,17,Fbeing discontinued in the English
OL,18,Fregions. Local continuity has been
OL,19,Fprovided in the English regions
OL,20,Ffive-days-a-week (Monday to Friday)
OL,21,Fsince April 1976.
OL,22,
