OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 12 SEP
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG2019FUK Food - a channel dedicated to
OL,7,Fcookery programmes - ceases
OL,8,Fbroadcasting.
OL,9,
OL,10,FThe channel was rebranded twice -
OL,11,Finitially as UKTV Food (March 2004) and
OL,12,Fthen Good Food (June 2009). UK Food was
OL,13,Foriginally owned by UKTV. In 2019 it
OL,14,Fbecame fully owned by Discovery, Inc.
